     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Fraction",
     "md": "A **fraction** is a part of a whole. The whole is cut into **equal** parts. The bottom number (denominator) says how many equal parts. The top number (numerator) says how many parts we take. 3/4 means 3 of 4 equal parts."
